      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `c00014c4960d0ca8a20fc88f6fab53b2fb066026b70b408a8289156ae86e91b2--45100_Table20_2005.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2005\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"NSW\" | 614b1cb640a77da25394f9b2d738c5b40f398090db78f9f6e4ae932fe1bc676a | missing |\n| \"Vic\" | 2bbd5e94fa9d184576d3498736f53d19f5de30653ed3074fa536cd83978feb84 | missing |\n| \"Qld\" | 9b3858f969b2a8eccee873a60c1bd09f789722d4ed88a4e0f6c2b8bb933f51ca | missing |\n| \"SA\" | c4a5dadefd634fd63dbe2fea98690ba30b6c1ecbeb9284b82307f790172ec994 | missing |\n| \"WA\" | 653c09a3aa601cbcff2703b832028c0d83fe7ed3663193fe57c30c0fef29e725 | missing |\n| \"Tas\" | 0549a07069ae7c3cf21d433b464bf93b64bf61adc2c66183fbd9e6a656f08e68 | missing |\n| \"NT\" | e9c7083d4784cd8b5c3287a0329509bb28ad0ba610b353a185c24921561c68de | missing |\n| \"ACT\" | c82fc7a54c857e67d8b90be1b006292ae38bf471b7e4ceb23ef6419c77ec0ec5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
